<title>FRANCE: Thomson-CSF 1997 Q1 sales dip.</title>
<headline>Thomson-CSF 1997 Q1 sales dip.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 6,877    vs    7,070</p>
<p>NOTE - Defence electronics firm Thomson-CSF published its sales figures in the official bulletin (Balo). It said turnover fell five percent on a like-for-like basis, compared to a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
